   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 8. Operators"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d821f89e-9a80-4e07-ab78-1308f1d42e4e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 8.1. Arithmetic Operators\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "| Operator | Description           | Example   | Example Result                       |\n",
    "|----------|-----------------------|-----------|--------------------------------------|\n",
    "| `+`      | Addition              | `x + y`   | If x=3 and y=2, the result is 5      |\n",
    "| `-`      | Subtraction           | `x - y`   | If x=5 and y=3, the result is 2      |\n",
    "| `*`      | Multiplication        | `x * y`   | If x=4 and y=3, the result is 12     |\n",
    "| `/`      | Division              | `x / y`   | If x=10 and y=2, the result is 5.0   |\n",
    "| `**`     | Exponentiation        | `x ** y`  | If x=2 and y=3, the result is 8 (2 to the power of 3)|\n",
    "| `%`      | Modulus               | `x % y`   | If x=5 and y=2, the result is 1      |\n",
    "| `//`     | Floor Division        | `x // y`  | If x=10 and y=3, the result is 3     |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 102,
   "id": "b38b8b41-3b3f-4e54-ac7a-3ad70ad89ccb",
   "metadata": {},
